{"id":"6bf4dc15ff0b29d5","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-prop-classification-surfaces.md","title":"Classification of Surfaces","display":"prop-classification-surfaces — Classification of Surfaces","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-classification-surfaces","aliases":["58-prop-classification-surfaces"],"display":"prop-classification-surfaces — Classification of Surfaces","depends_on":["[[58-df-manifold]]","[[58-df-homeomorphism]]","[[58-df-surface]]","[[58-df-compact]]","[[58-df-connected]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-classification-surfaces"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-classification-surfaces</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-classification-surfaces — Classification of Surfaces"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0e800aa519680c23\" href=\"?note=0e800aa519680c23\" title=\"58-df-manifold\">58-df-manifold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"58-df-homeomorphism\">58-df-homeomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"07a09ca243e6c6a3\" href=\"?note=07a09ca243e6c6a3\" title=\"58-df-surface\">58-df-surface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"58-df-compact\">58-df-compact</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"71801f5b9407391a\" href=\"?note=71801f5b9407391a\" title=\"58-df-connected\">58-df-connected</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,\\tau\\in V\">\\(S,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Manifold}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Manifold}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Connected}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Connected}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Orientable}\">\\(\\operatorname{Orientable}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\)</span> are the predicates from the displayed dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_g\">\\(\\Sigma_g\\)</span> denotes the standard closed orientable genus-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> surface with topology <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\Sigma_g}\">\\(\\tau_{\\Sigma_g}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_k\">\\(N_k\\)</span> the standard connected sum of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k&gt;0\">\\(k&gt;0\\)</span> projective planes with topology <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{N_k}\">\\(\\tau_{N_k}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}classification\\text{-}surfaces} \\vdash \\mathrm{Manifold}_S(S,\\tau,2)\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(S,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Connected}_S(S,\\tau)\\to\\Bigl((\\operatorname{Orientable}(S)\\land\\exists g\\in\\omega\\;\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(f,S,\\tau,\\Sigma_g,\\tau_{\\Sigma_g}))\\lor(\\neg\\operatorname{Orientable}(S)\\land\\exists k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(f,S,\\tau,N_k,\\tau_{N_k}))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}classification\\text{-}surfaces} \\vdash \\mathrm{Manifold}_S(S,\\tau,2)\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(S,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Connected}_S(S,\\tau)\\to\\Bigl((\\operatorname{Orientable}(S)\\land\\exists g\\in\\omega\\;\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(f,S,\\tau,\\Sigma_g,\\tau_{\\Sigma_g}))\\lor(\\neg\\operatorname{Orientable}(S)\\land\\exists k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(f,S,\\tau,N_k,\\tau_{N_k}))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The topology, compactness, connectedness, and homeomorphism witness are explicit; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_g\">\\(\\Sigma_g\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_k\">\\(N_k\\)</span> are fixed standard models rather than untyped uses of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong\">\\(\\cong\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Every connected closed orientable surface is homeomorphic to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_g\">\\(\\Sigma_g\\)</span>; the convention <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=0\">\\(g=0\\)</span> gives <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^2\">\\(S^2\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Every connected closed nonorientable surface is a connected sum of a positive number of projective planes, and the corresponding genus determines the homeomorphism class.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"0e800aa519680c23","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-manifold]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-homeomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-homeomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-surface","status":"resolved","id":"07a09ca243e6c6a3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-surface]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-compact","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-compact]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-connected","status":"resolved","id":"71801f5b9407391a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-connected]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Manifold}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compact}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Connected}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Orientable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_g","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\Sigma_g}","display":false},{"tex":"N_k","display":false},{"tex":"k>0","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{N_k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}classification\\text{-}surfaces} \\vdash \\mathrm{Manifold}_S(S,\\tau,2)\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(S,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Connected}_S(S,\\tau)\\to\\Bigl((\\operatorname{Orientable}(S)\\land\\exists g\\in\\omega\\;\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(f,S,\\tau,\\Sigma_g,\\tau_{\\Sigma_g}))\\lor(\\neg\\operatorname{Orientable}(S)\\land\\exists k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(f,S,\\tau,N_k,\\tau_{N_k}))\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_g","display":false},{"tex":"N_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\cong","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_g","display":false},{"tex":"g=0","display":false},{"tex":"S^2","display":false}],"bytes":1738,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3943","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-prop-classification-surfaces.md|58-prop-classification-surfaces]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["0e800aa519680c23","c4b4a825f2ea608d","07a09ca243e6c6a3","050f6d05b2c94aea","71801f5b9407391a"]}